# Paper branches

- Make all paper changes on the paper submodule's `main` branch, in its existing WSmart-Route checkout.
- Record paper submodule pointer updates directly on WSmart-Route's `main`; do not create a paper review branch.
- Do not push unless the user explicitly asks. Commit only authorized paper-related files and preserve unrelated working changes.
